      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start, it captures his vibe well. But looking at the automated review for this draft, the \"depth score\" is coming back really low—like, it's flagging it as \"critically undersized\" because the word count is so minimal. \n\nI know I said not to pad it, but we really need to get that score up so the system doesn't reject the quest file entirely. Can you expand on this? Try to build out the atmosphere of the Whispering Hollows more or maybe add some more cryptic details about the \"shattered crown\" itself. Just... keep it sounding natural and make sure it still feels like a professional narrative, not just a wall of text.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
